{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10358","headline":"送崔录事赴宣城 · 高适","name":"送崔录事赴宣城","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"大国非不理，小官皆用才。\n欲行宣城印，住饮洛阳桮。\n晚景爲人别，长天无鸟廻。\n举帆风波渺，倚櫂江山来。\n羡尔兼乘兴，芜湖千里开。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高适","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10358.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10358","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}